      "writtenOn": "2023-01-23T04:26:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I can see in other place. `mAdvertiser !\u003d null` is replaced with `mDeps.isMdnsAdvertiserEnabled(mContext)`. Why we do `request instanceof AdvertiserClientRequest` here instead?",
      "revId": "eeb3fc1f99a6f3e0e20c59034ca6b33c91b263e0",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "1ddbd8a6_876b4247",
        "filename": "service-t/src/com/android/server/NsdService.java",
