        "id": 1288034
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-01-31T07:52:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The feature flag may be changed while the request is registered; so when unregistering the service, the code needs to check the type of the request to unregister, not the value of the flag. So in general a flag check is used when adding a request, but an instanceof check is used when unregistering.\n\nAdded a comment.",
      "parentUuid": "c6aa6571_c5bbfe68",
      "revId": "eeb3fc1f99a6f3e0e20c59034ca6b33c91b263e0",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
